{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_aurora": {
        "attack": "【附加包】<#ff9028ff>驱灵奇术<>：每个敌人分别叠层，第三层造成1% + 每100<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0>2.7%最大生命魔法伤害，抽出灵物，<#ffb900ff>4秒<>内每秒<#66bb6aff>回复<>3–20 + 2%法强。<#ff9028ff>灵纱洞开<>：生命低于35%被贴身时后跳，隐身<#ffb900ff>1.25秒<>、加速30%（<#ffb900ff>20秒<>，参与击杀刷新）。",
        "skill": "【附加包】放出咒弹穿过敌人，造成<#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55%<>魔法伤害并留下诅咒；<#ffb900ff>0.67秒<>后抽回，回程造成<#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55%<>魔法伤害，按目标已损失生命最多+50%，对小兵40%、野怪50%。",
        "ult": "【附加包】朝敌方英雄跃出一小段，加速30%；前方的冲击波造成<#a974ffff>260<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<>魔法伤害并<#ef5350ff>减速<>30%，<#ffb900ff>0.75秒<>后成为领域（<#ffb900ff>2.25/2.75/3.25秒<>）：敌人碰到边界被<#ef5350ff>减速<>50%，她碰到边界穿到对面；里面没有敌人就提前关闭。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_aurora": {
        "attack": "【附加包】<#ff9028ff>精靈附體<>：每個敵人分別疊層，第三層造成1% + 每100<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0>2.7%最大生命魔法傷害，抽出精靈，<#ffb900ff>4秒<>內每秒<#66bb6aff>回復<>3–20 + 2%法強。<#ff9028ff>跨越兩界<>：生命低於35%被貼身時後跳，隱形<#ffb900ff>1.25秒<>、加速30%（<#ffb900ff>20秒<>，參與擊殺刷新）。",
        "skill": "【附加包】放出咒彈穿過敵人，造成<#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55%<>魔法傷害並留下詛咒；<#ffb900ff>0.67秒<>後抽回，回程造成<#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55%<>魔法傷害，按目標已損失生命最多+50%，對小兵40%、野怪50%。",
        "ult": "【附加包】朝敵方英雄躍出一小段，加速30%；前方的衝擊波造成<#a974ffff>260<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<>魔法傷害並<#ef5350ff>緩速<>30%，<#ffb900ff>0.75秒<>後成為領域（<#ffb900ff>2.25/2.75/3.25秒<>）：敵人碰到邊界被<#ef5350ff>緩速<>50%，她碰到邊界穿到對面；裡面沒有敵人就提前關閉。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_aurora": {
        "attack": "[Add-on] <#ff9028ff>Spirit Abjuration<>: stacks on each enemy; the third deals 1% (+2.7% per 100 <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0>) of his max health as magic damage and draws a spirit that <#66bb6aff>heals<> her 3-20 + 2% AP a second for <#ffb900ff>4s<>. <#ff9028ff>Across the Veil<>: under 35% health with an enemy on her, she hops back, invisible <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>, 30% faster (every <#ffb900ff>20s<>, reset by a takedown).",
        "skill": "[Add-on] A hex flies through her enemies for <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55%<> magic damage, cursing them; <#ffb900ff>0.67s<> later it is drawn back for <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55%<> magic damage, up to 50% more by the target's missing health (40% to minions, 50% to monsters).",
        "ult": "[Add-on] Leaps a short way toward an enemy champion, 30% faster; a shockwave in front of her deals <#a974ffff>260<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<> magic damage and <#ef5350ff>slows<> 30%, and <#ffb900ff>0.75s<> later becomes a rift (<#ffb900ff>2.25/2.75/3.25s<>): enemies touching its border are <#ef5350ff>slowed<> 50%, and when she touches it she crosses to the far side. It closes early once no enemy is left in it."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_aurora": {
        "attack": "[확장] 영혼 빛. <#ff9028ff>영혼 방호술<>: 적마다 따로 쌓여 세 번째에 최대 체력의 1% + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0>100당 2.7% 마법 피해, 영혼이 <#ffb900ff>4초<> 동안 매초 3–20 + 주문력 2% <#66bb6aff>회복<>. <#ff9028ff>장막 너머로<>: 체력 35% 미만에 적이 붙으면 뒤로 뛰어 <#ffb900ff>1.25초<> 투명, 이동 속도 +30% (<#ffb900ff>20초<>마다, 처치 관여 시 초기화).",
        "skill": "[확장] 주문 탄이 적을 꿰뚫어 <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55%<> 마법 피해와 저주; <#ffb900ff>0.67초<> 뒤 끌어당겨 <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55%<> 마법 피해, 대상의 잃은 체력에 따라 최대 +50% (미니언 40%, 몬스터 50%).",
        "ult": "[확장] 적 챔피언 쪽으로 짧게 도약하며 이동 속도 +30%; 앞쪽 충격파가 <#a974ffff>260<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<> 마법 피해와 30% <#ef5350ff>둔화<>, <#ffb900ff>0.75초<> 뒤 영역(<#ffb900ff>2.25/2.75/3.25초<>): 경계에 닿은 적은 50% <#ef5350ff>둔화<>, 그녀는 경계에 닿으면 반대편으로 건너간다. 안에 적이 없으면 일찍 닫힌다."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_aurora": {
        "attack": "【拡張】霊光。<#ff9028ff>精霊の解放<>：敵ごとに重なり、3回目で最大体力の1%＋<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0>100ごと2.7%の魔法ダメージ、精霊が<#ffb900ff>4秒<>間毎秒3–20＋2%魔力<#66bb6aff>回復<>。<#ff9028ff>ベールを越えて<>：体力35%未満で詰められると後ろへ跳び<#ffb900ff>1.25秒<>透明、移動速度+30%（<#ffb900ff>20秒<>ごと、キルかアシストで再使用）。",
        "skill": "【拡張】呪弾が敵を貫き<#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55%<>の魔法ダメージと呪い、<#ffb900ff>0.67秒<>後に引き戻し<#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55%<>の魔法ダメージ、失った体力に応じ最大+50%（ミニオン40%、モンスター50%）。",
        "ult": "【拡張】敵英雄の方へ短く跳び移動速度+30%。前方の衝撃波で<#a974ffff>260<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<>の魔法ダメージと30%<#ef5350ff>スロウ<>、<#ffb900ff>0.75秒<>後に領域（<#ffb900ff>2.25/2.75/3.25秒<>）：境界に触れた敵は50%<#ef5350ff>スロウ<>、彼女は境界に触れると反対側へ渡る。中に敵がいなければ早く閉じる。"
      }
    }
  }
}
